00:59:51.795 --> 00:59:52.503
Menyentuh urat.

00:59:52.586 --> 00:59:54.045
Ada darah di mana-mana.

00:59:54.628 --> 00:59:55.336
Lima jahitan.

00:59:57.170 --> 00:59:57.586
